WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.835
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:01.105 --> 00:03.945
Why is the cure for the curse here?

3
00:04.025 --> 00:05.305
Once the curse is lifted,

4
00:05.385 --> 00:08.945
the cursed person will lose all memories of the curser,

5
00:09.025 --> 00:10.665
as if they never knew each other.

6
00:10.745 --> 00:12.865
Your birthday is on the final day.

7
00:12.945 --> 00:15.305
I want us to share a memory that day.

8
00:15.385 --> 00:16.705
I'm sorry, Khobfa.

9
00:16.785 --> 00:20.625
I just want to stay in your memories a little longer.

10
00:20.705 --> 00:22.105
Just one more week.

11
00:22.945 --> 00:23.905
I'm excited.

12
00:24.625 --> 00:25.665
Excited about what?

13
00:27.465 --> 00:29.545
The band competition, obviously.

14
00:31.025 --> 00:32.385
Are you happy?

15
00:34.625 --> 00:37.825
Yeah. I'm really happy.

16
00:39.185 --> 00:40.785
What about you? Are you happy?

17
00:42.705 --> 00:46.145
Just seeing you do what you love makes me happy.

18
00:54.425 --> 00:56.025
Take that.

19
01:03.905 --> 01:07.745
Thank you for always believing in me.

20
01:23.585 --> 01:24.625
Hey!

21
01:26.905 --> 01:27.905
I'm going to sleep.

22
01:33.185 --> 01:37.345
Thanks for having the courage to open your heart again too.

23
01:46.545 --> 01:47.385
Hey!

24
01:48.025 --> 01:49.505
Whoa.

25
01:49.585 --> 01:51.825
You're taking advantage of me, huh?

26
01:57.625 --> 02:01.465
Hey, enough. Go to sleep.

27
02:02.865 --> 02:03.705
Sleep already.

28
02:06.825 --> 02:07.785
There you go again.

29
02:08.304 --> 02:11.105
Go sleep on your own pillow. Go. Move over.

30
02:11.185 --> 02:12.505
I just want to sleep close to you.

31
02:12.585 --> 02:13.945
Isn't this close enough?

32
03:13.425 --> 03:14.545
All right, everyone.

33
03:14.625 --> 03:17.745
Go ahead and practice, okay? Make it look cool.

34
03:17.825 --> 03:20.945
I'll record and send this to the seniors for the final rehearsal.

35
03:21.025 --> 03:21.905
Sure.

36
03:21.985 --> 03:24.025
-Ready? -Let's go.

37
03:24.625 --> 03:26.225
One, two, three.

38
03:26.825 --> 03:29.825
Wake up to the same old things

39
03:30.825 --> 03:33.945
And the world is never kind

40
03:34.865 --> 03:38.425
Feels like I did some wrong things

41
03:51.985 --> 03:53.505
Hey, guys. It's okay.

42
03:53.585 --> 03:56.025
Don't be tense. We can do this.

43
03:56.105 --> 03:57.465
Let's try again.

44
03:58.265 --> 04:01.705
Tell you what. I'll play and sing the chorus first.

45
04:01.785 --> 04:04.065
Then you guys join in, okay?

46
04:04.145 --> 04:05.865
-Yeah. -Okay.

47
04:12.425 --> 04:16.184
Maybe I'm a man who is so unlucky

48
04:16.265 --> 04:20.384
Like I've been cursed And everything gets messy

49
04:20.465 --> 04:23.145
Whatever I do ends in heartache

50
04:23.225 --> 04:26.985
Disappointment is my only friend

51
04:28.265 --> 04:31.985
But there's still one thing That somehow turned out right

52
04:32.065 --> 04:35.745
Whatever comes, I know you'll be there by my side

53
04:36.345 --> 04:39.705
No matter how unlucky life may be…

54
04:46.465 --> 04:47.785
Where the hell is it, Dan?

55
04:49.265 --> 04:50.105
I'm sorry, Rin.

56
04:57.665 --> 04:58.985
Hey, guys.

57
04:59.545 --> 05:01.985
The final competition is only a week away.

58
05:02.065 --> 05:04.745
Have some confidence. We can do this.

59
05:05.385 --> 05:08.425
Think about the prize money. A hundred thousand baht.

60
05:08.505 --> 05:09.905
A hundred thousand!

61
05:21.465 --> 05:25.385
Hey, I'll go get us some more snacks.

62
05:25.465 --> 05:27.665
But we've still got loads left.

63
05:27.745 --> 05:31.185
Yeah, we haven't even finished what you bought last time.

64
05:31.265 --> 05:34.505
You guys need to keep your energy up.

65
05:34.585 --> 05:36.985
You're practicing so hard. That takes energy.

66
05:37.065 --> 05:38.785
I'll go get some more.

67
05:47.065 --> 05:49.785
Guys, I need your advice.

68
06:01.265 --> 06:06.465
Please let everyone in Khobfa's band play well and win the final competition.

69
06:07.065 --> 06:10.545
If our band wins, we'll come play live for you.

70
06:11.705 --> 06:14.465
Amen.

71
06:20.505 --> 06:21.785
Amen!

72
06:21.865 --> 06:24.345
What? You're going to ask Rin out?

73
06:25.785 --> 06:26.705
Yeah.

74
06:26.785 --> 06:28.985
Wait, aren't you two already together?

75
06:29.065 --> 06:31.385
Yeah, I thought you made it official ages ago.

76
06:32.465 --> 06:35.545
No. We're still in the talking stage.

77
06:35.625 --> 06:37.465
But you sleep next to each other every night?

78
06:37.545 --> 06:39.185
You're basically boyfriends already.

79
06:40.025 --> 06:42.665
That's why I'm asking you guys.

80
06:44.825 --> 06:46.105
Hey.

81
06:48.945 --> 06:51.625
I really want to make things official with Rin.

82
06:54.585 --> 06:57.585
Do you think I should ask him to be my boyfriend?

83
06:57.665 --> 07:00.065
Ask yourself if you're ready first.

84
07:01.305 --> 07:04.545
But I think Rin likes you too.

85
07:04.625 --> 07:08.265
Yeah. You'll never know unless you try.

86
07:11.985 --> 07:14.105
So what do you guys think I should do?

87
07:15.785 --> 07:16.865
What are you guys doing?

88
07:16.945 --> 07:17.945
Huh?

89
07:18.025 --> 07:19.385
We were talking about practice!

90
07:19.465 --> 07:21.065
We were talking about practice.

91
07:21.145 --> 07:24.265
We were just discussing what to do at our next practice, right?

92
07:24.345 --> 07:25.745
-Yeah, that's right. -Yeah.

93
07:25.825 --> 07:27.505
Why'd you buy so much stuff?

94
07:28.105 --> 07:29.065
Yeah, seriously.

95
07:29.145 --> 07:30.465
-Whoa. -Look, Danthai.

96
07:31.065 --> 07:32.625
Why'd you buy so much red soda?

97
07:32.705 --> 07:34.865
Are they for God offering or something?

98
07:35.905 --> 07:40.865
It's still only you, as it's always been

99
07:40.945 --> 07:45.425
It's only you and it'll forever be

100
07:45.505 --> 07:46.865
What do you think of this song?

101
07:47.465 --> 07:48.945
Yeah, it sounds good.

102
07:49.025 --> 07:51.145
Hey!

103
07:51.225 --> 07:54.025
You two make such a good couple.

104
07:54.105 --> 07:56.585
What? You guys never stop teasing us.

105
07:56.665 --> 07:58.545
Can't help it. You're too cute together.

106
07:58.625 --> 08:00.705
Aww!

107
08:04.225 --> 08:06.225
DAD

108
08:10.385 --> 08:11.745
DAD

109
08:16.785 --> 08:19.785
So, is this song okay?

110
08:20.745 --> 08:24.465
It's good, but shouldn't you ask the rest of the band?

111
08:25.705 --> 08:27.705
Hey, what do you guys think?

112
08:27.785 --> 08:29.185
-It's fab! -It's fab!

113
08:31.185 --> 08:33.825
DAD

114
08:37.305 --> 08:39.865
You should answer. He might need something.

115
08:53.505 --> 08:54.585
What is it, Dad?

116
08:55.105 --> 08:56.745
I'm fine staying here.

117
08:56.825 --> 08:58.465
We know each other well.

118
08:58.545 --> 09:00.625
Mochi's been my friend since high school.

119
09:01.305 --> 09:04.385
Mochi took care of me when things were even harder.

120
09:06.505 --> 09:07.825
Why, Dad?

121
09:08.425 --> 09:10.825
Why does loving someone have to be so damn complicated?

122
09:10.905 --> 09:12.465
No matter what you say,

123
09:12.985 --> 09:14.825
I want to stay with Mochi.

124
09:14.905 --> 09:16.265
I'm hanging up, Dad.

125
09:36.585 --> 09:37.825
Thank you.

126
09:54.865 --> 09:56.025
Talking to the plant?

127
09:57.985 --> 09:59.665
You can talk to its owner too.

128
10:00.265 --> 10:01.905
It's wilting again.

129
10:03.945 --> 10:05.385
I wonder why.

130
10:09.345 --> 10:11.025
GRANDMA

131
10:12.305 --> 10:13.385
Hello, Grandma?

132
10:13.465 --> 10:15.505
It's all your fault, Khobfa!

133
10:15.585 --> 10:18.905
Grandma fell and got hurt because of you, you damn jinx!

134
10:18.985 --> 10:23.225
Why do you always make life so hard for everyone?

135
10:24.265 --> 10:26.385
Stay away from Grandma from now on. Understand?

136
10:26.985 --> 10:30.785
Don't let me catch you here again, or you're done for.

137
10:35.185 --> 10:36.185
Is something wrong?

138
10:41.665 --> 10:42.585
Grandma fell.

139
10:44.145 --> 10:46.505
My uncle just called.

140
10:47.505 --> 10:48.985
He said it was my fault.

141
10:51.585 --> 10:53.945
Khobfa, listen to me.

142
10:55.625 --> 10:59.585
It was an accident. It wasn't your fault at all.

143
10:59.665 --> 11:00.745
Okay?

144
11:26.945 --> 11:28.825
I love being with you like this.

145
11:30.225 --> 11:32.345
It feels like we're the only ones in the world.

146
11:36.665 --> 11:38.025
Aren't you a little dramatic?

147
11:38.785 --> 11:39.825
I mean it.

148
11:41.665 --> 11:43.425
I want to be with you forever.

149
11:44.425 --> 11:47.145
How do you know you'll be with me forever?

150
12:00.665 --> 12:02.225
Just allow me to.

151
12:04.625 --> 12:06.265
I'm waiting to be more than "F."

152
13:00.665 --> 13:02.185
You're a jinx.

153
13:02.265 --> 13:03.425
It's all your fault, Khobfa!

154
13:03.505 --> 13:06.985
Grandma got hurt because of you, you damn jinx!

155
13:07.065 --> 13:08.665
Everyone in this family died because of you.

156
13:08.745 --> 13:10.545
-Why didn't you die instead, Khobfa? -Hey.

157
13:10.625 --> 13:13.625
Khobfa, are you sure you're okay?

158
13:13.705 --> 13:15.745
You can take a break if you need to.

159
13:15.825 --> 13:18.225
Yeah, Khobfa. Don't push yourself if you're not okay.

160
13:18.305 --> 13:21.105
Right. I think we should take a break.

161
13:21.185 --> 13:23.305
No. Let me try again.

162
13:29.545 --> 13:30.505
Okay. Come on.

163
13:30.585 --> 13:32.145
Yeah. Try again.

164
13:36.465 --> 13:39.825
You should stop bringing bad luck to your friends, Khobfa.

165
13:39.905 --> 13:42.265
The band broke up because of you. You know that, right?

166
13:42.345 --> 13:43.585
You're a jinx.

167
13:43.665 --> 13:46.225
Grandma fell and got hurt because of you, you damn jinx!

168
13:48.345 --> 13:50.105
Everyone in this family died because of you.

169
13:50.185 --> 13:52.345
Why didn't you die instead, Khobfa?

170
13:53.985 --> 13:54.865
Hey, Khobfa!

171
13:55.465 --> 13:56.345
Khobfa!

172
13:56.425 --> 13:57.585
-Khobfa! -Khobfa!

173
13:57.665 --> 13:59.305
-Khobfa! -Khobfa!

174
14:00.385 --> 14:01.345
Khobfa!

175
14:19.625 --> 14:21.025
Be honest with me, Rin.

176
14:21.625 --> 14:22.705
What the hell happened?

177
14:22.785 --> 14:24.985
Does Khobfa have a medical condition?

178
14:25.065 --> 14:27.945
If you know something, tell us right now.

179
14:28.545 --> 14:29.385
Well…

180
14:30.945 --> 14:36.985
Khobfa's uncle called today and said his grandma fell.

181
14:37.065 --> 14:40.425
He blamed Khobfa for it, saying he was a jinx.

182
14:40.505 --> 14:41.665
-Huh? -Huh?

183
14:42.705 --> 14:44.425
What do you mean? I don't get it.

184
14:45.265 --> 14:46.305
Because…

185
15:00.385 --> 15:06.185
Rin, you know you can always tell us anything, right?

186
15:06.265 --> 15:07.705
Yeah, Rin.

187
15:07.785 --> 15:09.665
You can trust us.

188
15:14.505 --> 15:17.545
If it weren't for that curse, I wouldn't be here with him today.

189
15:18.145 --> 15:19.625
I feel so damn guilty.

190
15:19.705 --> 15:21.025
-Shit! -Shit!

191
15:21.665 --> 15:22.865
Is this for real?

192
15:22.945 --> 15:24.225
You cursed the wrong person?

193
15:24.305 --> 15:25.945
Then why don't you lift the curse?

194
15:26.025 --> 15:29.225
Yeah, Rin. Lift it.

195
15:32.225 --> 15:33.985
If I lift the curse,

196
15:34.585 --> 15:36.025
Khobfa will…

197
15:37.905 --> 15:40.705
lose every memory of me.

198
15:41.305 --> 15:42.705
-Huh? -Shit.

199
15:46.305 --> 15:48.265
Or should I lift the curse?

200
15:48.345 --> 15:49.705
-You should. -You should.

201
15:49.785 --> 15:51.665
Shouldn't you ask Khobfa first?

202
15:51.745 --> 15:55.145
Those memories don't just belong to you.

203
15:55.225 --> 15:56.945
They're his memories too.

204
16:00.385 --> 16:04.185
Starting over with the same person isn't easy.

205
16:04.785 --> 16:09.745
Honestly, the reason I pushed Khobfa to enter the band competition

206
16:12.665 --> 16:14.745
was that I wanted to see him win for once.

207
16:16.025 --> 16:20.785
At least he would know he could succeed at something.

208
16:25.065 --> 16:26.385
Then he'd…

209
16:27.665 --> 16:29.625
finally stop thinking he's a jinx.

210
16:35.905 --> 16:37.465
You guys have to help me.

211
17:01.665 --> 17:02.865
What are you looking at?

212
17:05.265 --> 17:06.745
Why'd you put it away so fast?

213
17:08.105 --> 17:09.665
It's nothing.

214
17:09.745 --> 17:11.585
I was just finishing up a chat with a client.

215
17:15.505 --> 17:18.464
Hey, I'm excited.

216
17:18.545 --> 17:20.184
The final round is coming up.

217
17:21.505 --> 17:24.105
You're good, Krit. You've got this.

218
17:27.224 --> 17:28.145
Thanks.

219
17:44.105 --> 17:45.385
Feeling any better?

220
17:46.985 --> 17:51.385
Getting some fresh air should help clear your head.

221
17:53.625 --> 17:56.345
Thanks for keeping me company.

222
17:57.665 --> 17:59.665
What happened earlier?

223
18:01.785 --> 18:03.825
Were you worried about your grandma?

224
18:07.705 --> 18:09.945
I've had it drilled into my head

225
18:10.545 --> 18:12.865
that I'd never amount to anything.

226
18:13.465 --> 18:17.465
And now Grandma got hurt because of me.

227
18:20.265 --> 18:22.345
Maybe my uncle's right about me.

228
18:25.505 --> 18:29.425
When will this damn bad luck finally go away?

229
18:32.385 --> 18:34.865
I don't want anyone else to suffer because of me.

230
18:40.105 --> 18:40.985
Khobfa.

231
18:43.225 --> 18:44.105
What if…

232
18:45.745 --> 18:49.545
I could make you lucky

233
18:50.505 --> 18:53.305
and give you the perfect life you've always wanted?

234
18:53.385 --> 18:55.065
No more bad luck.

235
18:55.145 --> 18:57.025
But it would mean losing me.

236
18:58.665 --> 19:00.305
Would you take it?

237
19:00.385 --> 19:01.385
No.

238
19:01.985 --> 19:03.705
Hey, at least think about it.

239
19:04.305 --> 19:08.545
This is your chance to stop being a jinx.

240
19:09.225 --> 19:11.585
How could I live without you?

241
19:18.745 --> 19:20.305
You'll be fine.

242
19:22.905 --> 19:25.505
You won't be the old Khobfa anymore.

243
19:26.985 --> 19:28.185
You'll be a great musician.

244
19:28.265 --> 19:29.625
You have a band

245
19:30.785 --> 19:31.865
and friends.

246
19:33.745 --> 19:35.225
Even without me…

247
19:42.145 --> 19:44.825
you can make your own luck now.

248
19:56.065 --> 19:58.385
If being lucky means

249
19:59.665 --> 20:01.545
not having you by my side,

250
20:03.185 --> 20:04.905
then how the hell is that lucky?

251
20:16.585 --> 20:18.345
Here's the melody I just revised.

252
20:19.145 --> 20:21.425
Follow along with the sheet music.

253
20:21.505 --> 20:24.105
Let's work on the melody first. I'll add the lyrics later.

254
20:24.185 --> 20:26.545
-You've got this. -Yeah. Leave it to us.

255
20:32.025 --> 20:33.945
Come on. Where should we start?

256
20:35.785 --> 20:37.825
Our band is getting in sync.

257
20:37.905 --> 20:41.945
If this keeps up, we'll do great in the final round.

258
20:43.145 --> 20:46.185
Yeah. Well done, Mr. President.

259
20:47.585 --> 20:51.545
Hey, when will the lyrics be ready?

260
20:51.625 --> 20:52.865
Give me a bit more time.

261
20:53.425 --> 20:55.665
I'm working on them. They'll be ready soon.

262
20:55.745 --> 20:57.665
I'm really putting my heart into this song.

263
21:34.305 --> 21:36.585
Whoa!

264
21:37.225 --> 21:38.745
Great job.

265
21:38.825 --> 21:40.185
Amazing, everyone!

266
21:40.265 --> 21:41.945
You guys are amazing!

267
21:42.865 --> 21:46.025
Tell you what. What do you want to eat? Dan and I will go get some snacks.

268
21:46.105 --> 21:48.385
Anything. Just pay for me.

269
21:48.985 --> 21:50.305
Same here.

270
21:50.385 --> 21:52.745
Seriously, you guys.

271
21:52.825 --> 21:55.305
What about you, Khobfa? Anything?

272
21:55.385 --> 21:58.705
I'll have whatever Rin's having. Whatever he gets, I'll get that too.

273
21:58.785 --> 22:02.065
Wow.

274
22:02.145 --> 22:05.185
We'll get going, then. Be right back.

275
22:05.265 --> 22:07.865
-Okay. Hurry back. -Okay.

276
22:10.825 --> 22:14.465
Ohm, Jinnie. I need to discuss something.

277
22:16.025 --> 22:16.865
Yeah? What's up?

278
22:16.945 --> 22:18.065
What is it?

279
22:18.145 --> 22:20.425
Remember what I asked you?

280
22:22.585 --> 22:24.345
About asking Rin to be my boyfriend?

281
22:26.505 --> 22:27.505
Yeah. What about it?

282
22:28.105 --> 22:30.345
I've never done anything like this in my life.

283
22:31.105 --> 22:32.625
I don't know what to do.

284
22:35.705 --> 22:38.865
You two are his close friends. Help me come up with a plan.

285
22:51.825 --> 22:53.105
Krit, where are you?

286
22:53.185 --> 22:54.665
I need your advice.

287
22:54.745 --> 22:56.025
Can you come see me?

288
22:59.465 --> 23:02.345
RIN

289
23:07.625 --> 23:08.585
Hello?

290
23:09.305 --> 23:10.705
Is something wrong, Rin?

291
23:14.305 --> 23:15.145
Rin.

292
23:16.985 --> 23:18.785
What did you need me for?

293
23:19.385 --> 23:22.225
The domain you set up for me has expired.

294
23:22.305 --> 23:25.185
I've qualified for an international art competition.

295
23:25.265 --> 23:28.425
But I need to put my portfolio together and send in my profile today.

296
23:28.505 --> 23:29.625
Can you help me?

297
23:34.825 --> 23:37.025
Okay. I've renewed it for you.

298
23:37.105 --> 23:38.505
You're all set for a long time.

299
23:39.385 --> 23:40.385
Thanks.

300
23:41.065 --> 23:43.345
I'll get going, then.

301
23:43.425 --> 23:44.745
Wait, Krit.

302
23:51.225 --> 23:52.225
Thank you.

303
23:55.145 --> 23:56.705
Thank you for everything.

304
24:01.825 --> 24:05.945
I'm sorry for everything too.

305
24:10.825 --> 24:12.785
For not taking better care of you.

306
24:13.305 --> 24:15.025
I owe you an apology too.

307
24:16.665 --> 24:21.825
I kept deciding everything for us without considering your feelings.

308
24:27.305 --> 24:30.105
But seeing you happy with Mochi now…

309
24:31.025 --> 24:32.585
I'm happy for you.

310
24:36.585 --> 24:37.545
You too, Rin.

311
24:41.105 --> 24:42.385
Good luck.

312
25:28.745 --> 25:31.945
I'm the reason Khobfa keeps having bad luck.

313
25:32.505 --> 25:37.345
If it weren't for that curse, I wouldn't be here with him today.

314
25:48.665 --> 25:49.705
What's up?

315
26:04.305 --> 26:08.025
Oh, nothing.

316
26:08.945 --> 26:12.545
I just wanted to ask about your band.

317
26:12.625 --> 26:13.865
How's practice going?

318
26:14.705 --> 26:16.265
Why do you ask?

319
26:16.345 --> 26:18.065
I'm looking forward to seeing you play.

320
26:19.025 --> 26:20.305
Just wait and see.

321
26:20.385 --> 26:22.945
I'll look forward to it, then.

322
26:42.745 --> 26:46.425
Wake up…

323
26:57.945 --> 26:59.185
"Wake up…"

324
27:00.625 --> 27:03.145
"Step out with the wrong foot and fall down a drain!"

325
27:03.225 --> 27:04.105
How's that?

326
27:04.185 --> 27:05.225
What the hell is that?

327
27:06.185 --> 27:07.065
How about this?

328
27:08.105 --> 27:11.585
Wake up to the same old things

329
27:12.905 --> 27:16.025
And the world is never kind

330
27:16.585 --> 27:20.185
Feels like I did some wrong things

331
27:20.265 --> 27:24.505
Even heaven's not on my side

332
27:25.305 --> 27:26.145
Sounds good?

333
27:26.225 --> 27:28.905
Hey, that works.

334
27:28.985 --> 27:30.585
Keep going.

335
27:30.665 --> 27:34.625
Maybe I'm a man who is so unlucky

336
27:34.705 --> 27:38.825
Like I've been cursed And everything gets messy

337
27:38.905 --> 27:40.425
Whatever I do…

338
27:40.505 --> 27:42.145
Once the curse is lifted,

339
27:42.225 --> 27:46.145
the cursed person will lose all memories of the curser,

340
27:46.745 --> 27:48.705
as if they never knew each other.

341
27:49.385 --> 27:50.425
What if…

342
27:50.505 --> 27:54.265
I could make you lucky?

343
27:55.025 --> 27:56.945
But it would mean losing me.

344
27:58.505 --> 27:59.625
Would you take it?

345
28:00.865 --> 28:01.745
No.

346
28:03.345 --> 28:05.825
How could I live without you?

347
28:07.665 --> 28:09.625
How was that? Sounds good?

348
28:12.545 --> 28:14.185
Yeah, it sounds good.

349
28:17.305 --> 28:18.345
Huh?

350
28:18.945 --> 28:19.905
What's this?

351
28:21.065 --> 28:21.905
Holy shit!

352
28:22.425 --> 28:23.265
Gold!

353
28:25.145 --> 28:27.145
It's real gold!

354
28:28.785 --> 28:29.865
Surprise.

355
28:29.945 --> 28:31.465
A gift for my talented artist.

356
28:32.825 --> 28:38.465
Congrats on qualifying for the international art competition.

357
28:38.545 --> 28:40.065
Great job.

358
28:41.625 --> 28:43.705
I've thought this through.

359
28:44.305 --> 28:46.945
Gold is an asset that tends to hold its value.

360
28:47.665 --> 28:50.065
Keep it, and it'll always be worth something.

361
28:52.865 --> 28:54.985
What does gold have to do with me?

362
28:55.065 --> 28:58.545
I want to invest in someone I like for the long haul.

363
29:00.745 --> 29:06.225
Gold prices may rise and fall with the market,

364
29:07.465 --> 29:12.025
but my feelings for you are 100% stable.

365
29:17.785 --> 29:19.505
You're so dramatic.

366
29:19.585 --> 29:20.945
I mean it.

367
29:21.025 --> 29:26.225
If gold ever hits a hundred thousand dollars,

368
29:27.825 --> 29:31.945
I hope you'll still be by my side.

369
29:38.545 --> 29:39.505
Yeah.

370
29:41.505 --> 29:43.905
How'd you know I qualified, anyway?

371
29:43.985 --> 29:45.985
Prof. James only told me this evening.

372
29:50.785 --> 29:51.985
Of course I know.

373
29:52.665 --> 29:55.385
Ohm, Jinnie, and Danthai all knew.

374
29:56.185 --> 29:59.545
I was the last one to find out.

375
30:03.185 --> 30:06.585
Aww. There, there.

376
30:06.665 --> 30:08.545
I was going to tell you.

377
30:08.625 --> 30:11.025
I just wanted to wait until I won and tell you all at once.

378
30:11.665 --> 30:15.865
You've been busy writing your song, so I didn't tell you.

379
30:16.465 --> 30:18.505
You never asked either.

380
30:23.745 --> 30:25.385
Then let me ask you now.

381
30:27.945 --> 30:30.385
Is there anything else you haven't told me?

382
30:31.825 --> 30:34.825
I want to know everything about you.

383
30:34.905 --> 30:38.025
I've told you everything about me.

384
30:39.385 --> 30:41.145
I haven't hidden anything.

385
30:43.305 --> 30:45.145
Are you hiding anything else from me?

386
30:46.865 --> 30:48.185
Why did you hide it from me?

387
30:48.265 --> 30:50.945
A presto amora!

388
30:51.025 --> 30:51.985
…LOSE ALL MEMORIES…

389
30:57.505 --> 30:59.065
I'm sorry, Khobfa.

390
31:09.825 --> 31:11.865
Are you worried about Khobfa?

391
31:13.465 --> 31:14.305
Yeah.

392
31:15.025 --> 31:18.425
Something's still weighing on me.

393
31:19.145 --> 31:22.425
Have you told him yet? About lifting the curse?

394
31:26.265 --> 31:27.225
Not yet.

395
31:28.425 --> 31:32.825
I'm afraid he won't be able to handle losing me.

396
31:34.705 --> 31:37.785
Aren't you the one who's scared?

397
31:40.185 --> 31:43.505
You're scared that lifting the curse

398
31:43.585 --> 31:47.305
will mean losing Khobfa, aren't you?

399
31:49.305 --> 31:51.985
You're afraid he'll look at you and see a stranger, right?

400
32:02.545 --> 32:03.385
Excuse me.

401
32:04.225 --> 32:06.345
Here's the Winner's introduction video.

402
32:18.745 --> 32:21.345
THE WINNER'S INTRODUCTION

403
32:25.265 --> 32:28.305
I'm the reason Khobfa keeps having bad luck.

404
32:28.385 --> 32:32.665
If it weren't for that curse, I wouldn't be here with him today.

405
32:34.185 --> 32:36.025
-The Winner, right? -Yes.

406
32:36.105 --> 32:37.745
I'll put it on to promote your band.

407
32:37.825 --> 32:40.585
-Put it on the big screen, please. -Sure. I'll put it on for you.

408
32:46.305 --> 32:48.945
Promise we'll stay friends forever.

409
32:49.025 --> 32:51.545
No dating within the group. Ever.

410
32:52.425 --> 32:53.265
Will you be my boyfriend?

411
33:06.345 --> 33:07.185
Mochi.

412
33:08.665 --> 33:09.585
Did you know?

413
33:09.665 --> 33:13.265
Khobfa's planning a surprise to ask Rin to be his boyfriend.

414
33:14.105 --> 33:14.945
What?

415
33:16.065 --> 33:19.505
What did you say, Krit? Khobfa's asking Rin to be his boyfriend?

416
33:20.345 --> 33:22.545
But you were hugging Rin the other day.

417
33:24.585 --> 33:28.625
Oh, I just renewed his domain for him.

418
33:29.145 --> 33:30.665
We hugged after clearing the air.

419
33:32.305 --> 33:37.345
Rin even said he was really happy to see how happy I am with you.

420
33:43.945 --> 33:46.945
WAIT FOR ME AT THE FACULTY. I'LL BE THERE SOON.

421
33:49.225 --> 33:50.785
Why?

422
33:50.865 --> 33:52.065
Were you jealous?

423
33:53.665 --> 33:56.585
I moved on from Rin ages ago.

424
34:01.065 --> 34:03.545
Aren't you the one who's scared?

425
34:03.625 --> 34:08.025
You're scared that lifting the curse will mean losing Khobfa, aren't you?

426
34:08.105 --> 34:10.945
You're afraid he'll look at you and see a stranger, right?

427
34:11.625 --> 34:13.105
Khobfa, today,

428
34:14.465 --> 34:16.065
you'll find out the whole truth.

429
34:17.865 --> 34:19.264
I'll be right back!

430
34:25.225 --> 34:26.264
Rin!

431
34:37.465 --> 34:40.625
Would you take someone unlucky as your boyfriend?

432
34:49.185 --> 34:51.185
BE MY BOYFRIEND

433
34:54.425 --> 34:55.945
Will you be my boyfriend, Rin?

434
34:57.105 --> 35:02.585
-Date him! -Date him!

435
35:02.665 --> 35:08.745
-Date him! -Date him!

436
35:08.825 --> 35:15.145
-Date him! -Date him!

437
35:20.385 --> 35:23.105
Whenever you're ready, you should tell him.

438
35:23.185 --> 35:24.585
Take a chance and see what happens.

439
35:55.825 --> 35:57.025
You're my boyfriend now.

440
36:14.025 --> 36:15.665
I'm sorry, Khobfa.

441
36:15.745 --> 36:18.625
I want to make a few more memories with you.

442
36:20.625 --> 36:22.625
I'm the heir to a family of mystics.

443
36:22.705 --> 36:25.905
That day, Krit broke up with me and started dating Mochi.

444
36:25.985 --> 36:27.825
I was furious.

445
36:27.905 --> 36:31.305
So I used the pen to cast a curse on Krit, wishing him bad luck.

446
36:31.385 --> 36:35.345
But I found out later that the pen belonged to Khobfa.

447
36:35.425 --> 36:39.305
So I cursed Khobfa instead.

448
36:39.385 --> 36:42.665
I'm the reason Khobfa keeps having bad luck.

449
36:45.345 --> 36:46.665
And I let him keep suffering.

450
36:46.745 --> 36:51.145
If it weren't for that curse, I wouldn't be here with him today.

451
37:25.865 --> 37:27.185
Is what you said

452
37:28.505 --> 37:30.065
in that video true?

453
37:30.985 --> 37:31.865
Khobfa…

454
37:37.185 --> 37:38.025
I…

455
37:39.345 --> 37:40.785
It's my fault.

456
37:45.145 --> 37:46.665
This is all my fault.

457
37:47.425 --> 37:50.065
I shouldn't have let things get this far.

458
37:55.305 --> 37:56.945
I was selfish.

459
37:59.265 --> 38:01.185
I'm such a fucking asshole.

460
38:25.025 --> 38:26.305
I'm sorry.

461
38:33.025 --> 38:36.265
Rin, I…

462
39:16.505 --> 39:18.545
Please take care of Khobfa for me.

463
39:33.385 --> 39:35.185
If you make the shot,

464
39:35.265 --> 39:37.185
I'll let you be my roommate.

465
39:38.505 --> 39:40.665
Yo, my roommate!

466
39:43.105 --> 39:43.945
-Deal! -Deal!

467
39:56.785 --> 39:59.225
Hey, can I leave my dad's pen with you?

468
39:59.305 --> 40:00.385
Of course.

469
40:01.345 --> 40:03.585
I'll take the best care of your dad for you.

470
40:03.665 --> 40:04.865
I promise.

471
40:04.945 --> 40:06.745
Good luck.

472
40:14.145 --> 40:16.465
It's called a dreamcatcher.

473
40:17.065 --> 40:20.025
You've been having nightmares and not getting enough sleep.

474
40:21.425 --> 40:22.985
I just wanted to help you.

475
40:33.145 --> 40:34.945
I've always worn this bracelet.

476
40:35.545 --> 40:37.785
I want you to look after it for me.

477
40:51.185 --> 40:52.625
Take that.

478
41:33.385 --> 41:36.305
THE CURSER MUST TAKE THE ITEM USED FOR IT, MAKE A WISH, AND RECITE "FINITO AMORA."

479
41:47.665 --> 41:49.665
Maybe forgetting me

480
41:49.745 --> 41:54.025
would be better than having to hate someone as awful as me.

481
41:59.345 --> 42:01.345
In a world without me,

482
42:01.945 --> 42:03.945
you'll finally be happy

483
42:04.545 --> 42:07.025
and have some real luck in life.

484
42:13.905 --> 42:16.425
Is what you said in that video true?

485
42:17.425 --> 42:18.865
Would you take someone unlucky

486
42:20.345 --> 42:22.105
as your boyfriend?

487
42:26.705 --> 42:28.905
…AND RECITE "FINITO AMORA."

488
42:28.985 --> 42:31.705
Finito amora!

489
42:45.505 --> 42:49.065
Maybe I'm a man who is so unlucky

490
42:49.145 --> 42:53.265
Like I've been cursed And everything gets messy

491
43:03.745 --> 43:04.905
What's wrong?

492
43:06.025 --> 43:07.865
I feel bad.

493
43:07.945 --> 43:09.905
You even bought me gold.

494
43:11.465 --> 43:12.865
Don't feel bad.

495
43:13.705 --> 43:15.545
You believe in this mystical stuff, don't you?

496
43:15.625 --> 43:20.545
People from the past used to believe gold could break curses.

497
43:21.145 --> 43:22.745
Now you can finally be lucky.

498
43:24.625 --> 43:27.185
Why should I be the only lucky one?

499
43:28.545 --> 43:30.105
It has to be both of us.

500
43:30.905 --> 43:32.865
We'll both be lucky.

501
43:32.945 --> 43:33.865
Yeah.

502
43:46.025 --> 43:47.465
Come on, let's go to bed.

503
43:49.025 --> 43:51.305
Wait, let go of my hand.

504
43:51.385 --> 43:52.505
No.

505
44:01.585 --> 44:02.505
Hey!

506
44:06.385 --> 44:07.625
Good luck.

507
44:20.865 --> 44:23.625
I broke the curse. Khobfa doesn't remember me anymore.

508
44:23.705 --> 44:24.825
You never know.

509
44:24.905 --> 44:26.745
He might still remember you.

510
44:26.825 --> 44:27.865
Watch where you're going.

511
44:28.745 --> 44:30.265
Khobfa really doesn't remember you.

512
44:30.345 --> 44:32.705
Do we still have to compete in the competition?

513
44:32.785 --> 44:33.985
You have to keep going.

514
44:34.065 --> 44:36.425
-You have to lead the band to victory. -You're responsible for it.

515
44:36.505 --> 44:37.825
Look after our band until the end.

516
44:37.905 --> 44:38.825
You can't quit.

517
44:38.905 --> 44:40.545
Why does this feel so familiar?

518
44:40.625 --> 44:42.425
It's like I've dropped someone off here before.

519
44:43.865 --> 44:45.185
We have no idea where Khobfa went.

520
44:45.265 --> 44:46.225
What?

521
44:46.305 --> 44:50.785
Let's hear it for Horizon!
